       PROCEDURE DIVISION.                                                      
      *==================>                                                      
      *                                                                         
       PRINCIPAL  SECTION.                                                      
      *====================                                                     
      *                                                                         
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO                                                  

           PERFORM 2000-PROCESO                                                 

           PERFORM 5000-FINAL                                                   
      *                                                                         
           CONTINUE.                                                            

       F-PRINCIPAL.                                                             

           GOBACK.                                                              

      ******************************************************************        
       1000-INICIO.                                                             
      ******************************************************************        

           PERFORM 1100-ABRIR-FICHEROS                                          
           PERFORM 1200-INICIAR-VARIABLES                                       
            .                                                                   

      ******************************************************************        
      * 1100-ABRIR-FICHEROS.                                           *        
      ******************************************************************        

      * ABRIMOS LOS FICHEROS TANTO EL DE ENTRADA COMO EL DE SALIDA              
       1100-ABRIR-FICHEROS.                                                     

           OPEN INPUT   FICH-ENT                                                
           SET SW-INI-FICH-ENT TO TRUE                                          
           SET NO-ERROR        TO TRUE                                          
           SET SI-ESCRITURA    TO TRUE                                          

           OPEN OUTPUT  FICH-SAL.                                               

      ******************************************************************        
      * 1200-INICIAR-VARIABLES.                                        *        
      ******************************************************************        

      * INICIALIZAOMS LAS VARIABLES                                             
       1200-INICIAR-VARIABLES.                                                  

           INITIALIZE WS-COPYS                                                  
               REPLACING ALPHANUMERIC DATA BY SPACES                            
                              NUMERIC DATA BY ZEROS                             

           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-FECHA-ACTUAL                        

           MOVE WS-ANO                   TO CB-INTRO-ANO                        
           MOVE WS-MES                   TO CB-INTRO-MES                        
           MOVE WS-DIA                   TO CB-INTRO-DIA                        

           INITIALIZE TOTALES                                                   
           INITIALIZE LIN-DETALLE-TOTAL                                         

           MOVE 0 TO CT-COMPL1                                                  
           MOVE 0 TO CT-COMPL2                                                  
           MOVE 0 TO CT-ERRORES                                                 

           MOVE 0 TO CT-COMPL1                                                  
           MOVE 0 TO CT-COMPL2                                                  
           MOVE 0 TO CT-ERRORES                                                 

           MOVE 0 TO CT-LINEA                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO CT-PAGE                                                    
           .                                                                    

      ******************************************************************        
       2000-PROCESO.                                                            
      ******************************************************************        

      * INICIALIZAMOS EL PROCESO CON LA LECTURA DEL FICHERO                     
           PERFORM 2001-LEER-REGISTRO                                           

           PERFORM UNTIL SW-FIN-FICH-ENT                                        
              PERFORM 4000-ESCRIBIR-INFORME                                     
              PERFORM 2001-LEER-REGISTRO                                        

           END-PERFORM                                                          

            .                                                                   

      ******************************************************************        
       2001-LEER-REGISTRO.                                                      
      ******************************************************************        

      * LECTURA DEL FICHERO AÑADIENDO UNO AL CONTADOR DE LECTURA                
           READ FICH-ENT INTO WS-REG-ENT                                        
             AT END                                                             
                SET SW-FIN-FICH-ENT TO TRUE                                     
           END-READ                                                             
              .                                                                 


      ******************************************************************        
       4000-ESCRIBIR-INFORME.                                                   
      ******************************************************************        

           INITIALIZE LIN-DETALLE                                               

           INITIALIZE FECHA-AUX                                                 
           MOVE WS-FECVENCIMICAP-S(1:4)    TO ANIO-AUX                          
           MOVE WS-FECVENCIMICAP-S(5:2)    TO MES-AUX                           
           MOVE WS-FECVENCIMICAP-S(7:2)    TO DIA-AUX                           

           MOVE FECHA-AUX                  TO DE-FECVEN                         


           PERFORM 4100-ESCRIBIR-LINEA                                          
            .                                                                   

      ******************************************************************        
       4100-ESCRIBIR-LINEA.                                                     
      ******************************************************************        

           IF CT-LINEA EQUAL 0 OR CT-LINEA > 58                                 
              MOVE 0 TO CT-LINEA                                                
              PERFORM 4110-IMPRIMIR-INTRO                                       
              ADD 1 TO CT-PAGE                                                  
           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE WS-POLIZA-S            TO DE-POLIZA                             
           MOVE WS-ANIO-S              TO DE-ANIO                               
           MOVE WS-KEXPEDIENTE-S       TO DE-EXPED                              

           EVALUATE WS-TIPOIMPORTE-S                                            

              WHEN '1'                                                          

                 MOVE WS-IMPORTE-S           TO DE-COMPL1                       
                 MOVE WS-ZEROES              TO DE-COMPL2                       
                 MOVE WS-ZEROES              TO DE-ERROR                        
                 ADD 1                       TO CT-COMPL1                       
                 ADD WS-IMPORTE-S            TO COMP1-TO                        

              WHEN '2'                                                          

                 MOVE WS-ZEROES              TO DE-COMPL1                       
                 MOVE WS-IMPORTE-S           TO DE-COMPL2                       
                 MOVE WS-ZEROES              TO DE-ERROR                        
                 ADD 1                       TO CT-COMPL2                       
                 ADD WS-IMPORTE-S            TO COMP2-TO                        

              WHEN 'A'                                                          

                 MOVE WS-IMPORTE-S           TO DE-COMPL1                       
                 MOVE WS-IMPORTE-S           TO DE-COMPL2                       
                 MOVE WS-ZEROES              TO DE-ERROR                        
                 ADD 1                       TO CT-COMPL1                       
                 ADD 1                       TO CT-COMPL2                       
                 ADD WS-IMPORTE-S            TO COMP1-TO                        
                 ADD WS-IMPORTE-S            TO COMP2-TO                        

              WHEN 'E'                                                          

                 MOVE WS-ZEROES              TO DE-COMPL1                       
                 MOVE WS-ZEROES              TO DE-COMPL2                       
                 MOVE WS-IMPORTE-S           TO DE-ERROR                        
                 ADD 1                       TO CT-ERRORES                      
                 ADD WS-IMPORTE-S            TO ERROR-TO                        
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY 'CT-ERRORES         ' CT-ERRORES                             
      *    DISPLAY 'CT-COMPL2          ' CT-COMPL2                              
      *    DISPLAY 'DE-ERROR           ' DE-ERROR                               
      *    DISPLAY 'WS-ZEROES          ' WS-ZEROES                              
      *F*                                                                       

           END-EVALUATE                                                         

      * IMPRIMIR-LINEA-DETALLE.                                                 
           MOVE LIN-DETALLE TO RTO-FICH-SAL                                     
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE                            
           ADD   1  TO  CT-LINEA                                                
                       .                                                        

      ******************************************************************        
       4110-IMPRIMIR-INTRO.                                                     
      ******************************************************************        

           MOVE CT-PAGE TO CB-INTRO-PAG.                                        

           MOVE CAB-INTRO   TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                                    
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE CAB-INTRO-1 TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                                    
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE CAB-INTRO-2 TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                                    
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE CAB-TITULO-1 TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                                   
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE CAB-TITULO-1-SUBRAYADO TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                         
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE CAB-TITULO-1-SUBTITULO TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                         
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE LINEA-BLANCO TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                                   
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE CAB-TITULO-2 TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                                   
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE CAB-TITULO-2-SUBRAYADO TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                         
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

           MOVE LINEA-BLANCO TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                                   
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

      ******************************************************************        
       4200-MOVER-TOTALES.                                                      
      ******************************************************************        
      * MOVEMOS LOS TOTALES A LAS MASCARAS                                      
           MOVE COMP1-TO       TO DE-COMPL1-TO                                  
           MOVE COMP2-TO       TO DE-COMPL2-TO                                  
           MOVE ERROR-TO       TO DE-ERROR-TO                                   

           MOVE CT-COMPL1      TO DE-NUM-COMPL1                                 
           MOVE CT-COMPL2      TO DE-NUM-COMPL2                                 
           MOVE CT-ERRORES     TO DE-NUM-ERROR                                  
              .                                                                 

      ******************************************************************        
       4300-IMPRIMIR-TOTALES.                                                   
      ******************************************************************        
           MOVE LIN-DETALLE-TOTAL-SUBRAYADO TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                    
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   
           MOVE LIN-DETALLE-TOTAL TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                              
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   
           MOVE LIN-NUMERO-TOTAL  TO RTO-FICH-SAL.                              
           WRITE RTO-FICH-SAL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.                          
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.                                                   

      ******************************************************************        
       5000-FINAL.                                                              
      ******************************************************************        

           PERFORM 4200-MOVER-TOTALES                                           
           PERFORM 4300-IMPRIMIR-TOTALES                                        

      * CIERRE DE LOS FICHEROS UTILIZADOS                                       
           CLOSE FICH-ENT                                                       
           CLOSE FICH-SAL.                                                      
